  "bodyHash": "07895d9ff5746ca1",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>鐵製告示牌（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</h1>\n<p>鐵製告示牌本身並不會比原版的木製告示牌好太多。它們價格便宜，最多可堆疊至 64 個，但本質上只是些灰暗且略帶鏽跡的鐵板。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/pintergabor/ironsigns/-/raw/release/images/screenshot1_s.png\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<p>它們的合成配方與原版木製告示牌類似：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/pintergabor/ironsigns/-/raw/release/images/crafting_iron_sign.png\" alt=\"製作鐵製告示牌\"> <img src=\"https://gitlab.com/pintergabor/ironsigns/-/raw/release/images/crafting_hanging_iron_sign.png\" alt=\"製作懸掛式鐵製告示牌\"></p>\n<p>不過，鐵製告示牌可以上色為 Minecraft 中的任何顏色：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/pintergabor/ironsigns/-/raw/release/images/painting_yellow_sign.png\" alt=\"為告示牌塗上黃色\"></p>\n<p>或者在製作時直接上色，效率更高：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/pintergabor/ironsigns/-/raw/release/images/crafting_yellow_sign.png\" alt=\"製作黃色告示牌\"></p>\n<p>這些色彩鮮豔、對比強烈的上色告示牌，接著可用來向你的朋友傳遞資訊：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/pintergabor/ironsigns/-/raw/release/images/screenshot2_s.png\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<p>或是向你的敵人：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/pintergabor/ironsigns/-/raw/release/images/screenshot3_s.png\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<p>或是向你的顧客：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/pintergabor/ironsigns/-/raw/release/images/screenshot4_s.png\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<p>自 1.0.2 版本起支援告示牌文字的上色與格式設定：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/pintergabor/ironsigns/-/raw/release/images/sign_editing_s.png\" alt=\"編輯告示牌\"></p>\n<h2>所需模組（Fabric）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></li>\n<li>選用模組（建議安裝）<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p>採用標準 MIT 授權條款。歡迎參考學習並將其融入您自己的專案中。<br>\n部分程式碼基於 <a href=\"https://github.com/ChristopherHaws/mc-text-utilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Text Utilities</a> 的原始碼，該專案採用 LGPL-3 授權。</p>\n<h2>原始碼</h2>\n<p>原始碼可於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fpintergabor%252fironsigns.git\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitLab</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/pinter-gabor-at/IronSigns.git\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 取得。</p>\n<h2>給開發者</h2>\n<p>此模組尚未在大型整合包或大型伺服器上進行廣泛測試。非常歡迎提供回饋。<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=mailto%253a%252f%252fpinter.gabor%2540gmx.at\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">電子郵件：Pintér Gábor</a> <a href=\"mailto:pinter.gabor@gmx.at\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pinter.gabor@gmx.at</a></p>\n<h2>未來計畫</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>方向指標告示牌</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<p>感謝 Kaupenjoe 提供了極具價值的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.udemy.com%252fcourse%252fminecraft-modding-120x-for-fabric%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modding By Kaupenjoe: Minecraft Modding 1.20.X for Fabric</a> 課程。<br>\n感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fChaws\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chaws</a> 公開 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftext-utilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Text Utilities</a> 的原始碼。</p>\n<h2>相關連結</h2>\n<p>我的其他模組請見 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpinter.gabor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pintergabor/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
